    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinReach? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectGrasped? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDO ProcessObject\n\t\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tEND\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO MoveToNextLocation\n\tEND\n"
